# Token-Saving Rules
Never read or index the following directories:
.pio/
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.vscode/

# Project Strategy
1. Always check 'platformio.ini' first for environment setup.
2. Use 'pio run' in the terminal to verify success, don't trust code analysis alone.
3. If an error occurs, only read the specific source files mentioned in the compiler output.